<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The New Shares will be issued at a price of KRW 1,600 per share for
a total issue size of KRW 36,800,000,000 (HKD 194,698,693.20). Payment is due on August 6, 2026, with the New Shares expected to be issued
on September 7, 2026, subject to the progress of Hong Kong registration and other regulatory filing procedures. The New Shares will be
delivered through the Securities Agency Department of the Korea Securities Depository (KSD) and will be subject to a lock-up period of
one (1) year.</P>

